<title>NETHERLANDS: Rabo Securities ups Oce to a Buy.</title>
<headline>Rabo Securities ups Oce to a Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of January research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector-----------Price---Broker--------</p>
<p>Oce-vd Grinten  office equipment 193.00  Rabo Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (from Hold)</p>
<p>Copier maker Oce's growth prospects promising for next few years. It will continue to benefit from investments made in new technologies and distribution capacity in U.S. Margins seen improving further and investors will become more interested as Oce will be included in Amsterdam's AEX index from February 24. Oce still undervalued compared to non-financial AEX stocks so it still has upward potential.</p>
</text>
